    "summary": "Bearer: a **HERETIC ASTARTES** model, not a **DAMNED** model.\n\nThe bearer's unit gets these:\n\n- [Falling Back](vsdata:core-rule/fall-back) does not stop it from shooting or from declaring a charge that turn\n- if it Fell Back this turn, attacks by its models against your [focus of hatred](vsdata:ability/chaos-space-marines.veterans-of-the-long-war.focus-of-hatred) get +1 to [Hit](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls)\n- whenever you declare a charge for it with your focus of hatred among its targets, it gets +1 to that [Charge roll](vsdata:core-rule/charge-step)",
